    "## 7. Package & Download Artifacts\n",
    "\n",
    "Packages `models/` and `results/` into a single zip file for direct browser download.\n",
    "After downloading, extract the zip into your local `ML mini Project` folder."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
